{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011160/extras/803b18beec2925e3b3a4f3868e863220.poster.avif?t=1774304543\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011160/extras/803b18beec2925e3b3a4f3868e863220.webm?t=1774304543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011160/extras/803b18beec2925e3b3a4f3868e863220.mp4?t=1774304543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brawl Burrow</strong> is a relaxing monster-catching game that runs quietly at the bottom of your screen. Instead of demanding constant attention, it surprises you with small interactions, like feeding your Brawlets, collecting coins, or stepping into battle. With 100 unique Brawlets to catch and care for, your collection will steadily grow as you play. You can also design and decorate your burrow, creating a home that reflects your style. Perfect for players who enjoy light interactions, Brawl Burrow is about collecting, caring, and customizing at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011160/extras/2613e711628858474c05ea42ca5b1d56.poster.avif?t=1774304543\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011160/extras/2613e711628858474c05ea42ca5b1d56.webm?t=1774304543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011160/extras/2613e711628858474c05ea42ca5b1d56.mp4?t=1774304543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: this game only works on Windows with a 16:9 landscape resolution (e.g. 1920x1080).</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011160?t=1774304543","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011160/475ba7d1f9cc3c41f67ec7f740e7e11f03b94708/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774304543","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011160/88b32e626f275b21a5050fefc62258948c35e14d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774304543","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011160/88b32e626f275b21a5050fefc62258948c35e14d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774304543","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4177530,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011160/extras/803b18beec2925e3b3a4f3868e863220.poster.avif?t=1774304543\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011160/extras/803b18beec2925e3b3a4f3868e863220.webm?t=1774304543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011160/extras/803b18beec2925e3b3a4f3868e863220.mp4?t=1774304543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brawl Burrow</strong> is a relaxing monster-catching game that runs quietly at the bottom of your screen. Instead of demanding constant attention, it surprises you with small interactions, like feeding your Brawlets, collecting coins, or stepping into battle. With 100 unique Brawlets to catch and care for, your collection 